<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Savior can bear every sorrow,</l><l>In Him there is comfort and rest;</l><l>No matter how great the affliction,</l><l>He only permits what is best.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Savior can strengthen the weary,</l><l>His grace is sufficient for all;</l><l>He knows every step of the pathway</l><l>And listens to hear when we call.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Savior can break sin’s dominion,</l><l>The vict’ry He won long ago;</l><l>In Him there is freedom from bondage,</l><l>He’s able to conquer the foe.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The Savior can satisfy fully</l><l>The heart that the world cannot fill;</l><l>His Spirit will sanctify wholly</l><l>The soul that is yielded and still.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
